{title: Kisi Raah Me Kisi Mod Par}
{artist: Mukesh Lata Mangeshkar}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] Kisi raah men, kisi mod par,        [D] Kahin chal na dena tu [Gm] chhodkar,
Mere [C] hamasafr, mere [D] hamasafr,        [D] Kisi haal men, kisi baat par
Kahin chal na dena tu [Gm] chhodkar,        Mere [C] hamasafr, mere [D] hamasafr
Mera [A] dil kahe kahin [Gm] ye na [D] ho,        Nahin ye [Gm] na [D] ho, nahin ye na ho
[D] Kisi roj tujh se bichhad ke main,        [D] Tujhe dhundhati firu [Gm] darabadar
Mere [C] hamasafr, mere [D] hamasafr,        Mere [C] hamasafr, mere [D] hamasafr
[D] Tera rang saaya bahaar ka,        [D] Tera rup aina pyaar ka
[D] Tujhe a najr men chhupa lun main,        [D] Tujhe lag na jaaye [Gm] kahin najar
Mere [C] hamasafr, mere [D] hamasafr,        Mere [C] hamasafr, mere [D] hamasafr
[D] Tera saath hai to hai zindagi,        [D] Tera pyaar hai to hai roshani
[D] Kahaan din ye dhal jaaye kya pata,        [D] Kahaan raat ho jaaye [Gm] kya khabar
Mere [C] hamasafr, mere [D] hamasafr,        Mere [C] hamasafr, mere [D] hamasafr
